---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import WasherInstallationIsland from '../components/islands/WasherInstallationIsland';

const serviceSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Service",
  "name": "Washer Installation",
  "description": "Free professional washer installation in Ocean Springs, MS included with every Sudsy Co. rental. We deliver, hook up, and level your machine.",
  "provider": {
    "@type": "LocalBusiness",
    "@id": "https://www.sudsycorentals.com/#localbusiness",
    "name": "Sudsy Co. Rentals",
    "telephone": "+1-228-338-3455",
    "address": {
      "@type": "PostalAddress",
      "streetAddress": "1302 Fort St",
      "addressLocality": "Ocean Springs",
      "addressRegion": "MS",
      "postalCode": "39564",
      "addressCountry": "US"
    }
  },
  "areaServed": {
    "@type": "State",
    "name": "Mississippi"
  },
  "url": "https://www.sudsycorentals.com/washer-installation/",
  "offers": {
    "@type": "Offer",
    "price": "0",
    "priceCurrency": "USD",
    "priceSpecification": {
      "@type": "UnitPriceSpecification",
      "price": "0",
      "priceCurrency": "USD",
      "unitText": "month"
    }
  }
};

const breadcrumbSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://www.sudsycorentals.com" },
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Washer Installation" }
  ]
};
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Washer Installation Ocean Springs MS | Free Setup | Sudsy Co."
  description="Free washer installation in Ocean Springs, MS with every Sudsy Co. rental. We deliver, hook up, and level your machine. No extra fees. Call (228) 338-3455."
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" slot="head" set:html={JSON.stringify(serviceSchema)} />
  <script type="application/ld+json" slot="head" set:html={JSON.stringify(breadcrumbSchema)} />
  <h1 class="sr-only">Washer Installation in Ocean Springs, MS</h1>
  <WasherInstallationIsland client:only="react" />

  <!-- Rich SEO content — server rendered -->
  <section class="bg-muted/30 py-16">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-4xl">
<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-3">H2: What Washer Installation Includes</h3>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">Every Sudsy Co. washer installation covers:
</p>
<ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-muted-foreground mb-4">
  <li><strong>Delivery to your door</strong> — we bring the machine inside, no curbside drops</li>
  <li><strong>Water line connection</strong> — we connect the hot and cold supply hoses</li>
  <li><strong>Drain line hookup</strong> — properly routed to your standpipe or utility sink</li>
  <li><strong>Leveling</strong> — machine is leveled to prevent vibration and noise</li>
  <li><strong>Test run</strong> — we run a cycle before we leave to make sure everything works</li>
  <li><strong>Haul-away of your old machine</strong> — if you have an old washer to get rid of, ask us about <a href="/old-washer-pickup" class="text-primary hover:underline">old washer pickup</a></li>
</ul>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">---
</p>
<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-3">H2: What You Need Before We Arrive</h3>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">Standard washer hookups require:
</p>
<ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-muted-foreground mb-4">
  <li>Hot and cold water supply valves (standard ¾" connections)</li>
  <li>A drain standpipe or utility sink nearby</li>
  <li>A 120V standard electrical outlet</li>
</ul>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">If your laundry space doesn't have existing hookups, we can talk through your options. Many Ocean Springs apartments and older Gulf Coast homes have non-standard setups — we've seen most of them.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">---
</p>
<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-3">H2: Washer Installation Included With Rental — $59.99/mo</h3>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">With Sudsy Co., you're not paying a separate installation fee on top of your rental. The $59.99/mo rental price includes delivery, installation, and ongoing maintenance. If the machine develops a problem after installation — won't drain, won't spin, leaks — you call us and we handle it.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">There's no contract and no credit check. Month-to-month, cancel anytime.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">---
</p>
<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-3">H2: Why Gulf Coast Residents Trust Sudsy Co. for Washer Installation</h3>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">Moving on the Gulf Coast is common — military families rotating through Keesler, renters moving between Ocean Springs, Biloxi, and Gulfport, people landing in a new apartment and needing laundry setup fast. Professional washer installation means you're not searching YouTube tutorials or hoping your machine doesn't flood your laundry room.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">We do this every day across Jackson County and Harrison County. Your installation is routine for us.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">---
</p>
<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-3">H2: Service Area</h3>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">We install washers across the Mississippi Gulf Coast:
</p>
<ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-muted-foreground mb-4">
  <li>Ocean Springs</li>
  <li>Biloxi</li>
  <li>Gulfport</li>
  <li>D'Iberville</li>
  <li>Pascagoula</li>
  <li>Gautier</li>
  <li>Long Beach</li>
  <li>Pass Christian</li>
  <li>Moss Point</li>
</ul>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">Next-day delivery and installation available across most of our service area.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">---
</p>
<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-3">H2: Schedule Your Washer Installation</h3>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">Call <strong>(228) 338-3455</strong> or <a href="#" class="text-primary hover:underline">start your rental online</a>. We'll confirm your delivery window — most installations happen next-day.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed"><strong>Sudsy Co. Washer and Dryer Rentals</strong> Locally owned. Ocean Springs, MS. Serving the Mississippi Gulf Coast.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">---
</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
